# Bank Reconciliation — Opening roll-forward

## Invariant

`ledgerOpeningBalance` for month **M** = prior month **Statement closing** (completed recon preferred), **not** Business Profile FY Opening Cash ($0).

Completing Jan/Feb must feed March Opening. With Mar bank lines Cleared 4/4 and Statement closing $795.62, Opening $100 → Difference ≈ **$0**.

## Bug observed (26 Aug 2026)

Every open session healed with `ledgerOpeningBalance: settingsOpeningCash` ($0). Jan/Feb Complete did not change March Difference **$100** (= Statement closing − month net only).

**Still stuck after prior-month roll:** Feb was completed while Statement closing was wrongly **$0**, so stored prior close stayed $0 and March Opening stayed $0. Fix: `reconcileLedgerOpeningWithStatement` — Opening = Statement closing − this month bank net when running balances exist (Mar: $795.62 − $695.62 = **$100** → Diff **$0**).

**Feb completed 0/0 at Statement closing $0:** No bank PDF lines that month (Cash Expense only). Empty month used Settings Opening $0 → Complete froze session. Heal completed empty months when live close (prior roll) > $0.

